WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:01.605
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.553 --> 00:00:03.364
A giant crowd!

3
00:00:03.364 --> 00:00:05.706
One stand is not enough!

4
00:00:05.706 --> 00:00:09.120
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

5
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.621
This is Episode 59.

6
00:00:11.621 --> 00:00:13.803
Meet the copy stands.

7
00:00:13.803 --> 00:00:15.811
The line gets long.

8
00:00:15.811 --> 00:00:17.056
Pop!

9
00:00:17.056 --> 00:00:18.929
A copy stand.

10
00:00:18.929 --> 00:00:20.556
Pop, pop!

11
00:00:20.556 --> 00:00:22.084
Two more.

12
00:00:22.084 --> 00:00:24.943
Now every friend gets a cup fast.

13
00:00:24.943 --> 00:00:26.743
Evening comes.

14
00:00:26.743 --> 00:00:28.690
The friends go home.

15
00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:31.019
The copy stands sink away.

16
00:00:31.019 --> 00:00:33.052
No empty stands.

17
00:00:33.052 --> 00:00:35.369
There is always one stand.

18
00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:38.093
And never more than the square can fit.

19
00:00:38.093 --> 00:00:41.100
Uh-oh, one copy stand is wobbly.

20
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.095
It sinks, and a fresh one pops up.

21
00:00:44.095 --> 00:00:46.695
More friends, more stands.

22
00:00:46.695 --> 00:00:49.455
Fewer friends, fewer stands.

23
00:00:49.455 --> 00:00:51.735
That is the copy stands.

24
00:00:51.735 --> 00:00:53.954
Now you know Auto Scaling!

25
00:00:53.954 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

